%% One observation's complete path through Aeroscope.
flowchart TD
  A[Source record<br/>readsb JSON or OpenSky states] --> B[Adapter<br/>parse, units, explicit nulls, attribution]
  B --> C{Structurally valid?}
  C -- no --> Q[Quarantine<br/>retain raw, reason]
  C -- yes --> D[Durable log append<br/>CRC framed]
  D --> E{Duplicate dedup key?}
  E -- yes --> X[Drop idempotently<br/>count log_duplicates]
  E -- no --> F[Fusion engine]
  F --> G{Older than watermark - lateness?}
  G -- yes --> L[Late revision<br/>retain as evidence]
  G -- no --> H{Plausible?}
  H -- no --> R[Reject<br/>retain conflicting evidence]
  H -- yes --> I[Conflict selection<br/>trust then recency]
  I --> J[Advance watermark<br/>update fused state]
  J --> K[Spatial grid upsert]
  K --> M[Viewport subscription<br/>snapshot or delta]
  M --> N[Client TrackStore<br/>resync invariant]
  N --> O[Globe render<br/>freshness label]
